insert into public.reading_passages (id, language, level, title, body, questions, sort_order, is_published)
values ('generated-reading-en-b1-4eaefa7d4507', 'en', 'B1', 'A Day to Remember: The Storm and the Surprise', 'Last Saturday, I woke up early because I had planned a special day. The sun was shining, and the birds were singing outside my window. I was feeling excited because my best friend, Ana, was coming to visit me after a long time. We had not seen each other for almost a year, so we wanted to make the most of our time together.

I was preparing breakfast when I heard a loud noise. At first, I thought it was thunder, but then I realized it was the sound of a truck passing by. I continued making coffee and toast, and I was humming a song when my phone rang. It was Ana. She said, “I''m almost there, but there''s a lot of traffic. I''ll be late.” I told her not to worry and that I was just relaxing at home.

While I was waiting for Ana, I decided to clean the house a little. I was putting away some books when I noticed an old photo album. I started looking at the pictures, and I was remembering our school days. We were laughing at the funny photos, and I was feeling nostalgic. Suddenly, I heard a car honk outside. It was Ana! She had arrived.

We hugged each other and started talking nonstop. We were catching up on all the news when Ana said she had a surprise for me. She pulled out a box from her bag. It was a beautiful necklace that we had seen together in a shop years ago. I was so touched that I almost cried. I thanked her many times.

Later, we went for a walk in the park. While we were walking, the sky started to get dark. We didn''t have an umbrella, so we hurried back home. Just as we reached the door, it started to rain heavily. We were laughing and getting wet. We went inside, dried ourselves, and made hot chocolate.

We spent the rest of the afternoon talking and listening to music. While we were chatting, I was thinking about how lucky I am to have such a great friend. That evening, while we were cooking dinner, we heard a loud thunderclap. The lights went out. We lit candles and continued talking in the dark. It was a bit scary, but with a friend, it was fun.

Finally, the storm passed, and the lights came back. We finished our dinner and watched a movie. While we were watching, Ana said she had to leave the next day. I felt sad, but I knew we would meet again soon. That day, I learned that simple moments with loved ones are the most precious. I will never forget that stormy but wonderful day.', '[{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"No texto, a narradora estava preparando o café da manhã quando Ana ligou. Ela menciona que estava fazendo café e torrada quando o telefone tocou.","options":["Preparing breakfast","Cleaning the house","Looking at photos","Walking in the park"],"prompt":"What was the narrator doing when Ana called?"},{"answer_index":1,"explanation_pt_br":"Ana trouxe um colar que elas tinham visto juntas em uma loja anos antes. A narradora ficou muito emocionada com o presente.","options":["A book","A necklace","A cake","An umbrella"],"prompt":"What did Ana bring for the narrator?"},{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"Durante o passeio no parque, o céu escureceu e começou a chover forte, então elas voltaram correndo para casa.","options":["It started raining","They were hungry","The park was closing","Ana felt sick"],"prompt":"Why did they go back home quickly?"},{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"Enquanto cozinhavam, houve um trovão forte e as luzes apagaram. Elas acenderam velas e continuaram conversando.","options":["The lights went out","The phone rang","The doorbell rang","A window broke"],"prompt":"What happened while they were cooking dinner?"},{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"A narradora diz que nunca esquecerá aquele dia, mostrando que foi um dia memorável e especial.","options":["It was unforgettable","It was boring","It was stressful","It was disappointing"],"prompt":"How did the narrator feel about the day?"},{"answer_index":0,"explanation_pt_br":"A história destaca a amizade entre as duas, mostrando como momentos simples com amigos são preciosos.","options":["The importance of friendship","The dangers of storms","The joy of cooking","The beauty of parks"],"prompt":"What does the story mainly show?"}]'::jsonb, 0, true)
