values ('generated-grammar-en-b1-8b9f91fa4c8b-exercise-03', 'en', 'B1', 'Exercise 3: Make a passive sentence', 'O objeto da ativa (a report) vira sujeito da passiva, e o verbo muda para ''was written'' (passado).', 'Active: Someone wrote the report.', 'Choose the correct passive form.', '["The report was written.","The report is written.","The report was wrote.","The report were written."]'::jsonb, 0, 3, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b1-8b9f91fa4c8b')
