values ('generated-grammar-en-b1-1f1de9b782e7-exercise-05', 'en', 'B1', 'Create a second conditional sentence', 'Escolha a opção que transforma a frase dada em um second conditional correto.', 'I don''t have a car, so I don''t drive to work.', 'Transform into second conditional: ''I don''t have a car, so I don''t drive to work.''', '["If I had a car, I would drive to work.","If I have a car, I will drive to work.","If I had a car, I will drive to work.","If I would have a car, I would drive to work."]'::jsonb, 0, 5, true, 'generated-grammar-en-b1-1f1de9b782e7')
